From: Codex local A376B compatibility adaptation
Subject: [PATCH] Retain AZH4 donor setup disclaimer

Reason and verification: postsettings73.txt:53,96 reports custom disclaimer resource/Activity patch failures. Skip only the cosmetic UN1CA disclaimer replacement for exact M2; preserve donor page. Navigation adaptation remains separate. Verify exact profile/path guard, shell syntax, replay and clean build.
Files: scripts/internal/apply_modules.sh.

---
--- a/scripts/internal/apply_modules.sh
+++ b/scripts/internal/apply_modules.sh
@@ -169,6 +169,11 @@
                 [[ "$p" == */settings/smali/system/priv-app/MultiSoundSetting/MultiSoundSetting.apk/0001-Allow-more-than-five-apps.patch ]]; then
             APPLY_PATCH "$PARTITION" "$FILE" \
                 "$SRC_DIR/unica/mods/settings/a376b/0001-Allow-more-than-five-apps.patch"
+            continue
+        fi
+        if [ "${ROM_SOURCE_CONFIG:-}" = "essi_a376b_android16" ] && \
+                [[ "$p" == */setupwizard/smali/system/priv-app/SecSetupWizard_Global/SecSetupWizard_Global.apk/0001-Add-custom-disclaimer-page.patch ]]; then
+            LOGW "AZH4 disclaimer Activity/resources differ; retaining donor disclaimer page for M2"
             continue
         fi
         APPLY_PATCH "$PARTITION" "$FILE" "$p"
